==============================================================================
TC7  Cheeger constant (PROVED 0)
==============================================================================
  Every multiple of q in a backward tree has only the doubling child, so the tree contains bare
  rays 3m, 6m, 12m, ...; a segment of L vertices has boundary 2, so inf |dS|/|S| = 0 on every tree
  (3n+-1, 5n+1).  Anchored expansion and br > 1 carry the transience instead.

